        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The dawn of the 15th century marks the beginning of the Age of Discovery.</strong><br>You will take on the role of Gil de Aiolia, a young Portuguese captain, setting sail from Lisbon toward the mysterious coasts of Africa, beginning your journey to explore uncharted continents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 Exploration &amp; Navigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vast open world, you can freely sail from Lisbon to Madeira, Marseille, Azores, Arguin, and Benin.<br>Each port has unique scenery and markets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new trade routes and uncharted seas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter various events and gradually reveal the world map</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Trade &amp; Economy System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich economic simulation system:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each port offers different goods and has distinct demands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can buy low and sell high, engage in long-distance transport, or hoard rare items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market prices fluctuate dynamically according to supply and demand</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Naval Combat &amp; Random Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seas are never safe, and you will face various challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pirate attacks and crew mutinies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh natural events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must make decisions: fight, flee, or negotiate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victories bring loot and honor, while failure may force you to start over</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Participate in Historical Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from 1415, the Age of Discovery unfolds, and you will take part in historical events, witnessing the progression of the era firsthand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical, realistic naval adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world navigation and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic trade and economic system, buy low and sell high</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naval combat and random events that challenge strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in historical events and experience the Age of Discovery</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The dawn of the 15th century marks the beginning of the Age of Discovery.</strong><br>You will take on the role of Gil de Aiolia, a young Portuguese captain, setting sail from Lisbon toward the mysterious coasts of Africa, beginning your journey to explore uncharted continents.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧭 Exploration &amp; Navigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this vast open world, you can freely sail from Lisbon to Madeira, Marseille, Azores, Arguin, and Benin.<br>Each port has unique scenery and markets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new trade routes and uncharted seas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter various events and gradually reveal the world map</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💰 Trade &amp; Economy System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a rich economic simulation system:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each port offers different goods and has distinct demands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can buy low and sell high, engage in long-distance transport, or hoard rare items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Market prices fluctuate dynamically according to supply and demand</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Naval Combat &amp; Random Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The seas are never safe, and you will face various challenges:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pirate attacks and crew mutinies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harsh natural events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must make decisions: fight, flee, or negotiate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victories bring loot and honor, while failure may force you to start over</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Participate in Historical Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting from 1415, the Age of Discovery unfolds, and you will take part in historical events, witnessing the progression of the era firsthand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >✅ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Historical, realistic naval adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open-world navigation and exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic trade and economic system, buy low and sell high</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Naval combat and random events that challenge strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in historical events and experience the Age of Discovery</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A sailing adventure and trade simulation set in the 15th century Age of Discovery. As a Portuguese captain, explore uncharted seas, build trade routes, and engage in naval battles to carve your own legend upon the tides.",
